# Data

This folder contains the phenotypic, genotypic, and mapping datasets used in the study.

Data may include:

- Grain measurement datasets
- F₂ segregation datasets
- F₃ progeny-test datasets
- Marker genotype data
- Fine-mapping datasets
- Recombinant classifications
- Candidate-marker validation datasets
- Germplasm survey results
- Supporting metadata and sample identifiers

Raw and processed data files will be organized as they become available and are finalized for publication.

Data are provided to support reproducibility of the analyses reported in the manuscript.
